$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=frmdgamadd  LOC_AFTER=?

* The operation of the free monoid on Gamma' is concatenation.

s1::eqid |- ( freeMnd ` Gamma' ) = ( freeMnd ` Gamma' )
s2::frmdgambas |- ( Base ` ( freeMnd ` Gamma' ) ) = Word Gamma'
s3:s2:eqcomi |- Word Gamma' = ( Base ` ( freeMnd ` Gamma' ) )
s4::eqid |- ( +g ` ( freeMnd ` Gamma' ) ) = ( +g ` ( freeMnd ` Gamma' ) )
qed:s1,s3,s4:frmdadd |- ( ( X e. Word Gamma' /\ Y e. Word Gamma' ) -> ( X ( +g ` ( freeMnd ` Gamma' ) ) Y ) = ( X ++ Y ) )
$)
